Every file read, edit, or creation for this prototype MUST be inside:
```
src/app/prototypes/observability-gen-ui-dashboards/
```

## STRICTLY FORBIDDEN
- ❌ Any edit to other prototype directories (including `observability-agentic-troubleshooting-ai`, which has a similarly named `DashboardsPersesPage.tsx`)
- ❌ Any edit to shared components, global CSS, or infrastructure outside this prototype's directory
